//------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Hospital Alert Investigation
// Story id used by collect_evidence: hospital_alert
//------------------------------------------------------------------------

title: HospitalWitnessApproach
---
<<declare $hospitalWitnessApproached = false>>
<<declare $hospitalWitnessTalkCompleted = false>>
<<declare $maintenanceTalkCompleted = false>>

<<if $hospitalWitnessApproached == true>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<set_patrol "HospitalWitness" false>>

<<walk_to "HospitalWitness" "Player" 2 true>>
<<face "HospitalWitness" "Player">>
<<face "Player" "HospitalWitness">>

Witness: Hey—sorry to bother you. Do you work for the press?
Witness: I'm on the night shift at Central District Hospital.

You: The state says rebels blew up the generator. What did you see?

Witness: I was here when the alert went out. No explosion. No rebels. Nothing like that.
Witness: Just the same blackout we've had for weeks.

You: So the bulletin isn't true?

Witness: I work here. I didn't see any attack.
Witness: Talk to maintenance near the service entrance—they'll tell you those generators have been dead for weeks.

<<collect_evidence "hospital_alert" "no_rebels_seen">>
<<set $hospitalWitnessApproached = true>>
<<set $hospitalWitnessTalkCompleted = true>>
<<set_enabled "HospitalWitnessDialogue" true>>
<<set_enabled "MaintenanceWorkerDialogue" true>>
<<show_text "QuestTalkToMaintenance">>

<<set_patrol "HospitalWitness" true>>
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

title: HospitalWitnessDialogue
---
<<if $hospitalWitnessTalkCompleted == false>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<face "HospitalWitness" "Player">>
<<face "Player" "HospitalWitness">>

Witness: Like I said—no rebels. Just broken equipment and state announcements.
Witness: Maintenance is still near the service entrance. They'll point you behind the hospital.

<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

title: HospitalMaintenanceTalk
---
<<if $maintenanceTalkCompleted == true>>
    Maintenance Worker: Round back, behind the hospital. You'll see both units offline.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<set_patrol "MaintenanceWorker" false>>
<<face "MaintenanceWorker" "Player">>
<<face "Player" "MaintenanceWorker">>

Maintenance Worker: Generators? Been busted for weeks. Neglect, not sabotage.
Maintenance Worker: We logged failures three weeks ago. No one from the state ever fixed them.
Maintenance Worker: If you want proof, go behind the hospital—you can see the backup unit yourself.

<<collect_evidence "hospital_alert" "generator_broken_weeks">>
<<set $maintenanceTalkCompleted = true>>
<<show_text "QuestPhotographGenerator">>

<<set_patrol "MaintenanceWorker" true>>
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===
